WEBVTT

00:11:57.063 --> 00:12:00.797
which are actually leveraging
information technologies

00:12:00.797 --> 00:12:02.430
for various applications.

00:12:02.463 --> 00:12:04.830
I mean, you think about work from home,

00:12:04.863 --> 00:12:07.297
which has happened during the pandemic,

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.497
and, you know, technology
and technology-based companies

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:13.663
are just, you know,
finding so many opportunities.

00:12:13.697 --> 00:12:17.463
Who had heard of Zoom
till the pandemic broke out?

00:12:17.463 --> 00:12:19.030
You know, things like that.

00:12:19.063 --> 00:12:20.230
SR: That's true.

00:12:21.197 --> 00:12:24.630
I'm curious, so you mentioned
sort of blockbusters

00:12:24.663 --> 00:12:27.997
and that's something else
that you talked about a little bit

00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:29.230
a couple of days ago.

00:12:29.263 --> 00:12:31.730
You said for some companies,